B.M4=s(['Three expense split types \u2014 equal, custom fixed amounts, and percentage-based \u2014 with live "remaining to allocate" feedback while entering an expense',"Multi-payer expenses: any subset of participants can jointly cover a single expense, each contributing a different amount","Live per-participant balance tracking (owes / is owed / settled), recomputed instantly across the group's full expense history",'Automatic settlement suggestions: a dedicated screen computes the minimal set of "who pays whom" transactions using a greedy debt-simplification algorithm',"Exact money math: all amounts stored as integers in minor currency units, avoiding floating-point rounding errors entirely","Layered architecture: pure, framework-free calculation services (split, balance, settlement math) fully decoupled from persistence and UI for independent unit testing",'Single shared "data revision" counter (Riverpod) that every write bumps and every derived view depends on, keeping balances and settlement suggestions always in sync without hand-written cache invalidation',"Hand-written local persistence layer (Hive) with explicit serialization adapters per entity, designed for safe schema evolution","Fully offline across Android, iOS, Web (installable as a PWA), Windows, and macOS from one codebase","11-file automated test suite covering split/balance/settlement logic, local-storage repository behavior, and an end-to-end scenario chained across the full calculation pipeline"],t.s)
